{
  "_about": [
    "BC standing-committee transcript seed list.",
    "",
    "Operator-curated catalog of known BC standing/special-committee transcript",
    "URLs on lims.leg.bc.ca/hdms/file/Committees/{parl}{sess}/{code}/.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS EXISTS:",
    "BC has no structured listing endpoint for standing-committee transcripts.",
    "Probed exhaustively on 2026-05-19 — LIMS HDMS /hdms/committees/{parl}{sess}",
    "returns 404; HDMS directory listings return 404; LIMS GraphQL has zero",
    "committee fields; leg.bc.ca per-committee pages are SPA-rendered with no",
    "meeting dates in static HTML; Drupal /jsonapi/ + ?_format=json are both",
    "disabled. Per-transcript URL fetch works cleanly (200 OK, ~140KB HTML)",
    "once the specific filename is known, so v1 ships with an operator-curated",
    "seed: the ingester reads this file and is correct + idempotent over",
    "whatever set it sees.",
    "",
    "ADDING NEW MEETINGS:",
    "1. Find the transcript URL (Google site:lims.leg.bc.ca, or paste a known",
    "   URL from leg.bc.ca's committee page).",
    "2. Append to the appropriate committee's transcript_urls list.",
    "3. Re-run ingest-bc-committees (idempotent on canonical_url).",
    "",
    "KNOWN COMMITTEE CODES (probed 2026-05-19 + re-probed 2026-05-25):",
    "Active in 43rd-1st (freshness canary watches these):",
    "  cay    - Children and Youth                       -> ChildrenYouth",
    "  fgs    - Finance and Government Services          -> Finance",
    "  dem    - Democratic and Electoral Reform          -> DemElecReform",
    "  pac    - Public Accounts                          -> PublicAccounts",
    "  health - Health                                   -> Health (not sat in 43rd-1st)",
    "Historical, mandate concluded (NOT in freshness canary):",
    "  rpa    - Reforming the Police Act                 -> 42nd Parliament only",
    "  rpea   - Review Provisions of the Election Act    -> 42nd Parliament only",
    "Special-prefix shape not supported in v1:",
    "  42nd-LAMC - Legislative Assembly Management Committee",
    "",
    "FUTURE: 43rd-2nd session opened 2026-02-24. Special Committee on the",
    "Insurance (Vehicle) Act (slug `iva`) struck 2026-04-22; first transcripts",
    "expected fall 2026. When 43rd-2nd transcripts start landing, the seed",
    "file's single (parliament, session) pin will need a restructure.",
    "",
    "UPDATE 2026-07-27: a structured listing endpoint NOW EXISTS. The dyn.leg.bc.ca",
    "React app (iframed into leg.bc.ca committee pages) reads",
    "  GET https://api.lims.leg.bc.ca/pcms/committees/meetings?filter=previous",
    "which returns {meetings:[...], hansardTranscripts:[{filePath,fileName,...}], pageInfo}.",
    "Paginate backward with &enCursor=<pageInfo.endCursor> (50/page, date-desc).",
    "Transcript URL = https://lims.leg.bc.ca/hdms/file{filePath}/{fileName}.",
    "Refresh workflow: pull that endpoint, append new Blues URLs here, re-run",
    "ingest-bc-committees. The 'published' flag is display-only — unpublished",
    "Blues fetch fine. LAMC is excluded (administrative committee; odd",
    "/Committees/43rd-LAMC path outside the {parl}{sess}/{code} grammar).",
    "Session is derived from each URL's path segment since 2026-07-27, so this",
    "file may mix 43rd1st/43rd2nd URLs freely; top-level parliament/session",
    "below are only a fallback for malformed URLs."
  ],
